      "message": "I agree with writing these in soong_injection. You can refer to the \"main repository\" from an external repo context by specifying `@` in the labels. So you don\u0027t need to pull them into the external repo.\n\ne.g. from some target in `@soong_injection`, you can refer to the main repo with `@//build/bazel/platforms/arch:x86`.\n\nI checked out your change locally and made soong_injection work with these patches:\n\n* build/bazel: https://paste.googleplex.com/6044897684488192?raw\n* build/soong: https://paste.googleplex.com/5284093754343424?raw",
